So now your focus shifts from sort of
deliberately learning the language to,

00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:11.400
you know, consuming a lot of interesting,
compelling content in that language.

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:13.350
Hi there Steve Kaufmann here.

00:00:13.470 --> 00:00:16.740
Um, today again, I'm going to
do this question and answer

00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:18.360
thing that I did last week.

00:00:18.390 --> 00:00:19.860
Uh, people seem to enjoy it.

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:23.110
Uh, I am able to deal with a
number of different subjects.

00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:27.930
Uh, remember if you enjoy these,
